5 must-see attractions in Thailand (best of the best)
1) Bangkok: Wat Pho + Grand Palace/Wat Phra Kaew — Thailand’s cultural heart, unmatched for first-timers.
2) Chiang Mai: Wat Phra That Doi Suthep (and the mountain viewpoint) — iconic north Thailand.
3) Khao Sok National Park (Surat Thani): Cheow Lan Lake — jaw-dropping limestone karsts and lake bungalows.
4) Krabi: Railay + Phra Nang — world-class cliffs, beaches, and sunsets in a compact area.
5) Ayutthaya Historical Park — immense, haunting ruins of the old Siamese capital (easy day trip from Bangkok).
